      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_6776e0d02d646b0fdddd993597a27190c77a49c3df8c73fb91fed9cd1a1b1e62"
      ],
      "text": "deepsec is an agent-powered vulnerability scanner that runs in the user's own infrastructure and is optimized for on-demand review of all code in large existing repositories."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_4515bc54b8dea6324ec52352965a33d705d16f5b71fc42048f809b5d9dcbd3be",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "23a69227e3380e6b44a7ebd93c52e023c59f17c3",
          "git_sha": "23bce6e2a2e83612581f9eb7f838f78121e5d17f",
          "line_end": 132,
          "line_start": 120,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "vercel-labs/deepsec",
          "url": "https://github.com/vercel-labs/deepsec/blob/23a69227e3380e6b44a7ebd93c52e023c59f17c3/README.md#L120-L132"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_b6ab9cb6056a01d8f8f2c7467a0ca0dd87df8320e0da4c57e845dc2cdd8a1c6e"
      ],
      "text": "The CLI exposes subcommands including scan, process, process --diff, triage, revalidate, enrich, report, export, metrics, status, and sandbox for running any command on Vercel Sandbox microVMs."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_0cd68a7deeb0d5589eca6e9ef4c41a8e2a0198956fe916baf77a719274b74867",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "23a69227e3380e6b44a7ebd93c52e023c59f17c3",
          "git_sha": "dd5af953a253e31b7db58e9491f658ae64afad95",
          "line_end": 91,
          "line_start": 86,
          "path": "docs/architecture.md",
          "repository": "vercel-labs/deepsec",
          "url": "https://github.com/vercel-labs/deepsec/blob/23a69227e3380e6b44a7ebd93c52e023c59f17c3/docs/architecture.md#L86-L91"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_570b57f69372e1052cd7b133af4bb3673408a6c87215180a8a57736ad81e65c9"
      ],
      "text": "The scan stage globs the project root, applies regex matchers to every matched file, and writes candidate matches into per-file FileRecords without any AI usage."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_7777d76bbabddc6e65eb53320a473bee7ba741f52299d0e907174cbed290f855",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "23a69227e3380e6b44a7ebd93c52e023c59f17c3",
          "git_sha": "dd5af953a253e31b7db58e9491f658ae64afad95",
          "line_end": 106,
          "line_start": 99,
          "path": "docs/architecture.md",
          "repository": "vercel-labs/deepsec",
          "url": "https://github.com/vercel-labs/deepsec/blob/23a69227e3380e6b44a7ebd93c52e023c59f17c3/docs/architecture.md#L99-L106"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_63a37450f5f67635a91dd3bb67e60d9da8f3ed356966f2cced6dc2beab0bcbe5"
      ],
      "text": "The process stage batches pending files, sends each batch to a configured AI agent backend with the system prompt and INFO.md, and parses JSON responses into findings stored on FileRecords."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_10c58a31819b721241fcc455430122a92831b302f6f55b8013bba0f8ecb9433e",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "23a69227e3380e6b44a7ebd93c52e023c59f17c3",
          "git_sha": "dd5af953a253e31b7db58e9491f658ae64afad95",
          "line_end": 108,
          "line_start": 108,
          "path": "docs/architecture.md",
          "repository": "vercel-labs/deepsec",
          "url": "https://github.com/vercel-labs/deepsec/blob/23a69227e3380e6b44a7ebd93c52e023c59f17c3/docs/architecture.md#L108-L108"
        },
        {
          "commit": "23a69227e3380e6b44a7ebd93c52e023c59f17c3",
          "git_sha": "dd5af953a253e31b7db58e9491f658ae64afad95",
          "line_end": 114,
          "line_start": 110,
          "path": "docs/architecture.md",
          "repository": "vercel-labs/deepsec",
          "url": "https://github.com/vercel-labs/deepsec/blob/23a69227e3380e6b44a7ebd93c52e023c59f17c3/docs/architecture.md#L110-L114"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_85d411266fa3095cc24080332b508c759fa18c81222e5d9301d864718e1e9299",
        "slc_9d07663489998534d86a58377d52d5b1db59885f982568bab0c7a90420180073"
      ],
      "text": "Three agent backends are supported for process: codex (default, via @openai/codex-sdk), claude (via @anthropic-ai/claude-agent-sdk), and pi (via @earendil-works/pi-coding-agent), each with a documented default model."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_bb5b194cf2f2df691e327770bca86bd9eaa7e2c15fe808a947e6585cdbac2611",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "23a69227e3380e6b44a7ebd93c52e023c59f17c3",
          "git_sha": "dd5af953a253e31b7db58e9491f658ae64afad95",
          "line_end": 186,
          "line_start": 184,
          "path": "docs/architecture.md",
          "repository": "vercel-labs/deepsec",
          "url": "https://github.com/vercel-labs/deepsec/blob/23a69227e3380e6b44a7ebd93c52e023c59f17c3/docs/architecture.md#L184-L186"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_3ea74cbe3d9aad300a1421f1d85bcd61fbef95c5d337aa757e9a3d498612e603"
      ],
      "text": "The unit of work is a source file rather than a finding, which the architecture doc says makes per-file atomic locking and idempotent merges natural."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_c1cb44e3925745ed552930bc70b4e219fd30ee62dabc58da7de0d9bf2bfb1b0a",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "memory-state",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "23a69227e3380e6b44a7ebd93c52e023c59f17c3",
          "git_sha": "db63d6b8df09926941f85e0d08b01207ac0f7cce",
          "line_end": 91,
          "line_start": 88,
          "path": "docs/data-layout.md",
          "repository": "vercel-labs/deepsec",
          "url": "https://github.com/vercel-labs/deepsec/blob/23a69227e3380e6b44a7ebd93c52e023c59f17c3/docs/data-layout.md#L88-L91"
