          "git_sha": "dd5af953a253e31b7db58e9491f658ae64afad95",
          "line_end": 61,
          "line_start": 58,
          "path": "docs/architecture.md",
          "repository": "vercel-labs/deepsec",
          "url": "https://github.com/vercel-labs/deepsec/blob/23a69227e3380e6b44a7ebd93c52e023c59f17c3/docs/architecture.md#L58-L61"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_28c5474d4eba18f01fa30f0efafe566fee1f4bdccf5aa73ff14ff168d85edb52",
        "slc_413a4265df77cb8c514956999424c5faa9457e425fef44128f2c5561ed0227e9"
      ],
      "text": "On-disk state is append-only: re-scans merge new candidates, re-processing appends to analysisHistory and merges findings, and revalidation annotates findings with verdicts without overwriting or deleting anything."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_464516511c0919624e784e1287d95cab321c0ff3b445638529795cef84d4a7c6",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "memory-state",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "23a69227e3380e6b44a7ebd93c52e023c59f17c3",
          "git_sha": "db63d6b8df09926941f85e0d08b01207ac0f7cce",
          "line_end": 110,
          "line_start": 98,
          "path": "docs/data-layout.md",
          "repository": "vercel-labs/deepsec",
          "url": "https://github.com/vercel-labs/deepsec/blob/23a69227e3380e6b44a7ebd93c52e023c59f17c3/docs/data-layout.md#L98-L110"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_e8d3fa9abf7aac43adb82caffb27c7990ab3793caeaafe409bbe0e6e39a3d0a0"
      ],
      "text": "Each FileRecord tracks candidates, findings, an append-only analysisHistory, gitInfo, a lifecycle status (pending/processing/analyzed/error), and a lockedByRunId field used for atomic file claiming."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_3a44982f7830f0ddfd911d65ad3ee8c631bb4b12577bfd9a9ec30d95bf42a145",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "23a69227e3380e6b44a7ebd93c52e023c59f17c3",
          "git_sha": "dd5af953a253e31b7db58e9491f658ae64afad95",
          "line_end": 123,
          "line_start": 120,
          "path": "docs/architecture.md",
          "repository": "vercel-labs/deepsec",
          "url": "https://github.com/vercel-labs/deepsec/blob/23a69227e3380e6b44a7ebd93c52e023c59f17c3/docs/architecture.md#L120-L123"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_cb16aa889aa2c72fb5d77695f747240a31297bcdd581f142dbaed7f03685b02e"
      ],
      "text": "The processor claims files atomically via lockedByRunId so multiple workers can run in parallel; concurrency and batch size flags control how many files are in flight."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_cf77ee141d897b14cc35dd32e20cbd72396bd21915c0650cb9c4a8b573b60d40",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "23a69227e3380e6b44a7ebd93c52e023c59f17c3",
          "git_sha": "23bce6e2a2e83612581f9eb7f838f78121e5d17f",
          "line_end": 11,
          "line_start": 8,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "vercel-labs/deepsec",
          "url": "https://github.com/vercel-labs/deepsec/blob/23a69227e3380e6b44a7ebd93c52e023c59f17c3/README.md#L8-L11"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_dc712595cffc4c496861c874624f36bdd13787736f8f6c79ad6768f2355de2d9"
      ],
      "text": "For large codebases, work fans out across worker machines in parallel, and interrupted or errored runs can be re-run to resume, skipping already-analyzed files."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_9f355c8aff5522ff4e5fff4d92c2cdf6af4521e831cb6e1ae00c01db6135e1ae",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "23a69227e3380e6b44a7ebd93c52e023c59f17c3",
          "git_sha": "23bce6e2a2e83612581f9eb7f838f78121e5d17f",
          "line_end": 105,
          "line_start": 102,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "vercel-labs/deepsec",
          "url": "https://github.com/vercel-labs/deepsec/blob/23a69227e3380e6b44a7ebd93c52e023c59f17c3/README.md#L102-L105"
        },
        {
          "commit": "23a69227e3380e6b44a7ebd93c52e023c59f17c3",
          "git_sha": "23bce6e2a2e83612581f9eb7f838f78121e5d17f",
          "line_end": 96,
          "line_start": 96,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "vercel-labs/deepsec",
          "url": "https://github.com/vercel-labs/deepsec/blob/23a69227e3380e6b44a7ebd93c52e023c59f17c3/README.md#L96-L96"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_d4708cc499914287a3b40b03fca34e987868dddd5038cd09d420082a792639a7",
        "slc_f6df29827f6a0eb32f89526dc1250fb82810e429a454f0f60aacdbfba202b56c"
      ],
      "text": "Large monorepos can optionally fan work across Vercel Sandbox microVMs; the local working tree is tarballed and uploaded (excluding .git), and model credentials stay host-side and are injected only at the egress host."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_b2dfed48c617a9f5d12e5edd6b4643f2bcadeb989857841d6c018705cfcd7d0d",
